Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/dotsoftwarelk/m-os
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mos-desktop-config
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, mos-branding (>= 0.1.0), ufw, apparmor
Conflicts: desktop-base
Recommends: plasma-workspace, sddm, fcitx5, fcitx5-m17n, systemd-zram-generator
Description: M OS desktop and system defaults
 System-wide defaults for M OS: KDE Plasma configuration (M OS Modern
 layout, M OS Dark theme, Inter font, Papirus icons), SDDM login screen,
 screen locking, Sinhala input method profile, zram swap for 4-8 GB
 computers, kernel/network hardening and a first-boot firewall setup
 (deny incoming, allow outgoing).
